<newsitem itemid="205400" id="root" date="1996-11-20" xml:lang="en">
<title>GERMANY: Merck nine-mo profit profits rise.</title>
<headline>Merck nine-mo profit profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT, Germany 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months of year</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   365     vs n/a</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   693     up 10.6 pct</p>
<p>    Turnover				     5,156   up 10 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German pharmaceuticals group is Merck KGaA.  </p>
<p>    Result from ordinary activities	577     up 25.2 pct</p>
<p>    Cash flow				    694     up 13 pct</p>
<p>    Result after deduction of minorities 341     up 25 pct</p>
<p>Turnover by business unit:</p>
<p>    Pharma					 2,891   up 13 pct</p>
<p>    Labor					  1,240   up six pct</p>
<p>    Speciality chemicals		     972     up five pct</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
